 mark  and he is a kind of chosen one in the  series as much as he wants to deny it  but in his defense it truly appears like  his father had more of the signs and  talent you would usually associate with  a chosen one than tanjiro himself after  all the chosen sun breather was supposed  to be born with a mark on his forehead  while tundra wasn't and his dad was the  reason tanjura's burn looking mark  didn't awaken like tangeros did in my  opinion is because he didn't actually  come into contact with demons it is only  after tanjuro undertakes the path of the  demon slayer that his mark eventually  evolves and starts to look more and more  like urichis i think the same thing  would have happened with tanjuro if his  parents and siblings were killed and he  joined the demon circle to beat muzon  and it's significant that tanjuro died  before the family was attacked by muzon  because tanjuro was arguably skilled  enough to make a difference or at least  complicate muzon's attack on the family  we can't say for sure what would have  happened especially since tanjuro didn't  have a nichiren blade as far as we know  but i feel like he would have at least  been able to distract muzon long enough  for more family members to escape it  definitely seems like he had the speed  for that so if we compare tundra to  yorichi or even to his own father he  wasn't really a genius and doesn't give  off chosen one vibes as hard which is  refreshing about this story it doesn't  have to be a series like naruto where  naruto surpasses that and everyone else  tanjo could just do his best get help  from others and accomplish his goals  without reaching his father's level of  mastery and definitely without reaching  yurichi's level of mastery i hope i've  shown and proven how overpowered tundra  actually was in this video the reason he  is easy to overlook is that a he died  before the story begins and before he  confronted any demons and b because he  as far as we know never actually got a  nitrogen blade and demon slayer training  however if we pay close attention to the  story and take note of what tundra can  accomplish when he glimpses the power  his father could maintain then it's  clear to see how overpowered he actually  was yes he probably could have benefited  from a nitrogen blade and swordsmanship  training but he didn't have the need for  either in his lifetime and even without  training we saw what he could do with a  tiny axe so i bet he wouldn't have much  trouble adjusting to the sword if he was  given the chance i'd go so far as to say  that tundra's dad is the closest anyone  got to yorichi's level of skill and it's  a shame we didn't get to see his skills  transferred over to demon fights but it  was necessary for the story since  tanjiro wouldn't have been able to  improve and struggle if his father  became the sun hoshida and just wrecked  all the demons for him so to conclude  tundra's dad was so strong he had to be  killed off before the demon fighting  arrived so that tanjiro would be forced  to grow into his full potential but also  keep in mind although it was suggested  that tanjuro was naturally more talented  in sun breathing than tanjiro he was  also way older and only during the last  few years of his life had the sunset to  sunrise dancing become more or less easy  for him tundra on the other hand is only  16 when the story ends despite  everything he's accomplished already and  it's very likely that he'll be just as  good at performing the dance and  maintaining the selfless state as his  father was given enough time and that is  it for this one hope you enjoyed this  deep dive into tanjuro aka tanjiro's dad  his skill and his unrealized but massive  potential as a demon slayer if you did  enjoy this video and want to keep them  coming you know what to do chill the  demonstration and smash that like button  with no mercy remember smashing that  like button is strongest demon slayer  energy and passing his scared moose on  energy so choose wisely make tundra's  dad proud if you have it make this the  video subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  demonstrator videos and updates  including updates about the very very  hype new seasons and while you wait for  the next video to drop or the next  season even feel free to check out my  huge and growing demonstrator playlist  that includes videos in all the demon  moons hashira why everyone is afraid of  tanjiro yurichi's full story and much  more link to that is in the description  and until next time see ya space cowboys
 

